WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The Syrian people in the squares

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
To the capital raising banners

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
He is writing in three words

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
God, Syria and Bashar

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
We are your Bashar

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The church and the university are united

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
And for love is the title of religion

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
And full of Syrians

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
And they only want Bashar

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
We are your Bashar
